      "pt-BR": "A entrada mudou antes de ser restaurada.",
      it: "La voce \xE8 cambiata prima del ripristino.",
      tr: "Girdi geri y\xFCklenmeden \xF6nce de\u011Fi\u015Fti.",
      "zh-CN": "\u6761\u76EE\u5728\u6062\u590D\u524D\u5DF2\u66F4\u6539\u3002",
