      it: "L\u2019importazione di Compass accetta al massimo 25 schede per lotto.",
      tr: "Compass i\xE7e aktar\u0131m\u0131 parti ba\u015F\u0131na en fazla 25 kay\u0131t kabul eder.",
      "zh-CN": "Compass \u5BFC\u5165\u6BCF\u6279\u6700\u591A\u63A5\u53D7 25 \u6761\u8BB0\u5F55\u3002",
