      "pt-BR": "O anexo n\xE3o est\xE1 dispon\xEDvel.",
      it: "L\u2019allegato non \xE8 disponibile.",
      tr: "Ek kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.",
      "zh-CN": "\u9644\u4EF6\u4E0D\u53EF\u7528\u3002",
