      "pt-BR": `O instant\xE2neo filtrado n\xE3o passou nas verifica\xE7\xF5es SQLite: ${result}.`,
      it: `L\u2019istantanea filtrata non ha superato i controlli SQLite: ${result}.`,
      tr: `Filtrelenmi\u015F anl\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC SQLite denetimlerini ge\xE7medi: ${result}.`,
